{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104144514011-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104150616\"/><p>高等法院下令恒大實業控股即時清盤。</p><p>已被頒令清盤的中國恒大集團，旗下的恒大實業控股有限公司於今年8月入稟高院，自行提出清盤呈請，案件今日(4日)於高院聆案官林澤銘席前提訊。林官批准呈請方的呈請，下令恒大實業控股即時清盤。</p><p>呈請方為恒大實業控股有限公司（Evergrande Industrial Holdings Limited），由於入稟文件為非公開文件，公眾不得查閱，故未能知悉恒大實業控股實際債務情況。</p><p>案件編號：HCCW 659/2026</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.314779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:45:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.730260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:19:00.452169+00:00","content_hash":"729ca6f04c552f909efffe2e2d265cc55bb27823695961e3f847c937e0103503","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.314779+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}